  "description": "Conversion of dwellinghouse into four self-contained residential flats involving alterations including excavation of basement/lower ground floor; provision of side and front lightwells, addition of rooflights, inset roof balcony, PV panels, alterations to existing fenestration, introduction of gate to side boundary wall and replacement of windows to double-glazed timber sash window.",
  "subdivision_of_building": null,
  "actual_completion_date": null,
  "lpa_app_no": "2024/0255",
